Date: Fri, 07 Aug 2026 01:18:43 +0530
Subject: [PATCH v4 3/3] arm64: dts: exynos7870-j6lte: add Sharp GP2AP070S
 proximity sensor
Precedence: bulk
X-Mailing-List: linux-samsung-soc@vger.kernel.org
